  "description": "A long-standing prejudice against Jewish people, often manifesting in stereotypes, discrimination, and hate. The meme's use of the term 'jewish prisoners' in conjunction with the image of suffering individuals, combined with the colorization label, may be intended to reinforce antisemitic tropes by reducing the victims to a 'colorized' image, which can be interpreted as a form of dehumanization or commodification of trauma.",
